o/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご大福おいしい。\n生のいちごもおいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご最高"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも家出る何分前に起きるー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいたい3時間前に起きるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしゃ目覚まし何個設定してるか...あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの今の夢って何ですか？\n僕達が力になれることってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままでいてください＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の夢は...\n私の笑顔で沢山の人が\n笑顔いっぱいになってほしい。\n今だけじゃなく、これからもずっとそう‼\n笑うことって大事です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのコメントや\nお手紙、プレゼント、直接会って、\nすごいパワーをもらっています。\nすごく笑顔になります。すごく元気になります。\nそれと同じように私もいろんな人に\nパワーを与えたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内面から輝ける人になりたい＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの得意教科なんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育と美術です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...怒らないで←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"82回目のブログより\nパーティーの写真で、べびたんが、\n手にもってるものはなんだろう？(^o^)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップケーキ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺も質問してもいいのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんですともっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声のフェチ？\nどんな感じですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな声が好みなのか興味があります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やんわり小声のつぶやく感じの声が\nすきなんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ⁇マニアックって⁇笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、ストール大好きで20着くらい持ってるんだけど、\nストール男子はどう思いますか？\nちなみに首に巻くのと、\n腰に巻くのはどっちがオシャレだと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もストール女子だったりします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストール男子ありですっ♪\n大ぶりで顔の半分見えないバランスとか\nいいですよね^^\n腰に巻いたことない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参考になりますっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんって\n女子高校生に好きって\nいわれて嬉しい？☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃもうむちゃくちゃうれしいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢も近いから、いろんな話できる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいお話したいです:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツの男はどない？笑っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツって大人にイメージがあるな。\nしゃきーんて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の子の髪色で好きなのって\nあったりするのかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に似合ってれば\n何色でも良いなて思います。\n自分的にはナチュラルな感じ好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.gi