nって、もう、なってるよ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツッコんでるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいすごいうれしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばっきゅんします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの夢が見れる魔法ってなんだっけ？(笑)\nちちんぷいぷいだっけ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちちんぷいぷいずんちゃずんずんずんちゃっちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n笑\nみんな笑っていいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わらわらわら←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さくまり」\nって呼んでいいですか?笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、まりかって呼んで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生映画って興味ある??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観たことないのですが、\n映画だいすきなので観たいなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女マンガ読む男の子って変かな???"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変じゃなーーい‼\n私は少女漫画しか読んでないけど、\n少年漫画読んでる女の子いっぱいいますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女漫画は読むと女の子の気持ちが分かりそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0035.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0036.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらもうこんな時間‼\nおやすみなさいっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーーーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-4771":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/14/9682986/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい通常のブログは今日を最後に10日ほど更新されませーん('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか。不思議ですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜならひめたんは普通の高校生。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故に。にゃにゃせ意識。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中間テスト対策期間に突入するのです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いややああああああああ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーてもやらんにゃいけないの(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生なって初めてのテスト。正直不安です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやるしかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/14/9682986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/14/9682986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/14/9682986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけですが、10日間ブログを放置したらひめきゅんさんが寂しい...よね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん寂しいと思うから。あれです。あれが復活します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月の終わりの受験期にちらっとやったことあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らないよって方が多いよね。そりゃそうだ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようは簡単に言うと、過去の質問がえしをまとめて貼っておくから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを読んでもっとひめたんのこと詳しくなってねってこと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10日間も読んだらきっとひめたんマスター"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/14/9682986/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて。今日はお知らせをぶっこみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりやすいように青い文字で書きますから安心してーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっこめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島イベントのこと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月9日に広島で、グリーンアリーナでイベントさせていただけるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しくて、いや嬉しすぎてやーばいんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふと思ったんよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜入るまで広島帰らん!っていったじゃん...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみにこの前のアグレッシブの撮影は都内でーした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたつめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日ふらげ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがブログをおやすみする10日間のあいだに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人がお誕生日するとかどーゆーこっちゃねん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけでちょっとはやいけどおめでと言っちゃう(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16日・れーか(桜井玲香chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19日・らりん(永島聖羅chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日・ななせまる(西野七瀬まる!)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10日後にまた会おーう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃおす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}}